    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-21T17:52:29+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T17:52:29+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T07:22:29Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T07:22:29Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough of low pressure and cold front about the west, will move over the remainder of South Australia on Sunday. Another cold front clips the southeast on Monday, followed by a high pressure system, which will then move across southern parts of the state on Tuesday. A trough of low pressure approaches the western border on Wednesday whilst a cold font moves over waters to the south.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW009" description="Flinders" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-21T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Winds west to northwesterly 15 to 25 km/h shifting northeasterly during the afternoon and evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of raised dust north of Hawker in the morning and early afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm south of Hawker in the late morning and early afternoon. Winds north to northeasterly 25 to 40 km/h shifting west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h in the late morning. Overnight temperatures falling to 22 to 28 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 39.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 8:50am to 5:10pm, UV Index predicted to reach 12 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">The chance of a thunderstorm north of Hawker in the morning and early afternoon. Sunny afternoon. Winds southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h turning southerly in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 24 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 24 to 29.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-26T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-25T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly during the day then tending southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
